{'symbol': 'CAT', 'date': '2022-12-14 12:29:00', 'title': 'CATERPILLAR INC. MAINTAINS DIVIDEND', 'text': 'IRVING, TEXAS , DEC. 14, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF CATERPILLAR INC. (NYSE: CAT) VOTED TODAY TO MAINTAIN THE QUARTERLY\xa0DIVIDEND\xa0OF\xa0ONE DOLLAR AND TWENTY CENTS ($1.20) PER SHARE OF\xa0COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE FEBRUARY 17, 2023, TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT\xa0THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON\xa0JANUARY 20, 2023. CATERPILLAR HAS PAID A CASH DIVIDEND EVERY YEAR SINCE THE COMPANY WAS FORMED AND HAS PAID A QUARTERLY DIVIDEND SINCE 1933.'}